OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA dry
OL,6,Fevening is expected away from the
OL,7,Fcoast, where there could be the odd
OL,8,Flight shower. Clear spells will
OL,9,Fdevelop overnight, allowing some mist,
OL,10,Ffog and frost patches to form during
OL,11,Fthe night.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTuesday:FAreas of fog will be slow to
OL,14,Fclear on Tuesday morning, but sunny
OL,15,Fspells will slowly develop. Isolated
OL,16,Fcoastal showers continuing.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
