OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FMostly
OL,6,Fdry with sunny spells during this
OL,7,Fperiod, with isolated showers mainly
OL,8,FWednesday and Thursday. Perhaps some
OL,9,Fearly fog Wednesday. Temperatures
OL,10,Fturning colder with widespread
OL,11,Fovernight frosts.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
